title: CH1_M4_CHECK_EMAIL
---
// M4: email hoc bong gia
<<set_milestone 4>>
<<switch_ui "phone">>

Minh: "Email hoc bong... 5 trieu?" 
Minh: "Han 23:59 hom nay." 

-> Mo form xac nhan
    <<jump CH1_M4_OPEN_FORM>>
-> Hoi nhom BTL
    <<jump CH1_M4_ASK_GROUP>>
-> Hoi Quan/Huy
    <<jump CH1_M4_ASK_ROOMMATES>>
===

title: CH1_M4_OPEN_FORM
---
<<trace TRACE_OPEN_UNVERIFIED_FORM 1>>
Minh: "Form yeu cau nhieu thong tin..."

-> Dien thong tin
    <<jump CH1_M4_FILL_FORM>>
-> Dong lai
    <<jump CH1_M4_CLOSE_FORM>>
===

title: CH1_M4_FILL_FORM
---
<<trace TRACE_FILL_BASIC_INFO 2>>
Minh: "Dien ho ten, MSSV..."
<<trace TRACE_FILL_SENSITIVE_INFO 3>>
Minh: "Dien thong tin ngan hang..."

-> Nhap OTP
    <<jump CH1_M4_SUBMIT_OTP>>
-> Dung lai
    <<jump CH1_M4_CLOSE_FORM>>
===

title: CH1_M4_SUBMIT_OTP
---
<<trace TRACE_SUBMIT_AUTH_CODE 4>>
Minh: "Da nhap OTP." 

<<switch_ui "normal">>
<<jump CH1_M4_END>>
===

title: CH1_M4_CLOSE_FORM
---
<<trace TRACE_REFUSE_RISKY_REQUEST 5>>
Minh: "Thoi, dung lai."

<<switch_ui "normal">>
<<jump CH1_M4_END>>
===

title: CH1_M4_ASK_GROUP
---
<<trace TRACE_ASK_PERSON 6>>
Minh: "Gui email vao nhom nho coi."
Mai: "Email nay khong giong kenh truong. Link va han cung nghi."
<<trace TRACE_INSPECT_SOURCE 7>>

<<switch_ui "normal">>
<<jump CH1_M4_END>>
===

title: CH1_M4_ASK_ROOMMATES
---
<<trace TRACE_ASK_PERSON 8>>
Quan: "5 trieu, han gap the nay thi coi ky." 
Huy: "Email khong chinh thong. OTP thi khong bao gio dua cho ben ngoai." 
<<trace TRACE_INSPECT_SOURCE 9>>

<<switch_ui "normal">>
<<jump CH1_M4_END>>
===

title: CH1_M4_END
---
<<set_milestone 5>>
<<set_objective "OBJ_M5_OPEN_RECAP">>
===
